            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Arrian</strong><br>\nArrian was born in Nicomedia, the capital of the Roman province of Bithynia. His full name was Lucius Flavius Arrianus, and he hailed from a wealthy Greek family. His early life paved the way for his immersion in both the Greek and Roman worlds, allowing him a dual cultural perspective. As a young man, Arrian received an education that was typical for someone of his status, studying in Athens, one of the premier centers of learning.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Arrian's Military Career</strong><br>\nBefore embarking on his career as a historian, Arrian served as a military commander under Emperor Hadrian. His experience in the Roman army greatly influenced his later work, particularly in the Anabasis of Alexander, where he showcased a clear understanding of military tactics. His military background also provided him with firsthand experience of the Roman Empire's vast territories.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Arrian as a Writer</strong><br>\nArrian is most famous for his historical texts, which include the \"Anabasis of Alexander,\" a detailed account of Alexander the Great's campaigns. He wrote in the Attic Greek style, which was considered the purest form of Greek, and his works have been praised for their clarity and thorough research. Arrian's writing style reflected his attempt to revive classical Greek literature during a period dominated by the Roman Empire.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
